{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1055050-so-can-mages-go-to-different-dimensions-and-such","id":1055050,"title":"So can mages go to different dimensions and such?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-25T19:57:59-08:00","id":1055050,"title":"So can mages go to different dimensions and such?","content":"<a href=\"http://wiki.wodgotham.com/images/f/fa/Machinery_of_the_Stars_by_alexiuss.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://wiki.wodgotham.com/images/f/f...y_alexiuss.jpg</a><br /> <br /> I saw an awesome fan art and was intrigue. Mages can travel to different dimensions called the Umbra? What does it look like? Would it look like the above picture?<br /> <br /> I went on Google and searched &quot;Mage the awakening Umbra&quot; and found that image.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1945,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","user":"Magicballz","date":". 02-25-2017, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T20:06:28-08:00","id":1055054,"title":"","content":"This is the nWoD/CofD forum, where mages explore the inner expressions of the Astral Realms and the totemic reflections of the Shadow Realm. oWoD/cWoD/just plain WoD Mage is the one where mages travel through the Near Umbra and reach further into the Horizon.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure either game can find a good place for your inspirational artwork (whether or not it's one of the game's otherworlds). It's just a question of what is evoking it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T20:30:56-08:00","id":1055063,"title":"","content":"Yeah, so the Umbra is a Mage the Asenscion thing. Mages in Mage the Awakening can travel to other worlds, but the Umbra isn't a thing in the world in which Awakening is set. That image looks awesome though, gives me a very God-Machine vibe. Or it could be an Obrimos' Awakening, with the skyscraper in the center of the skyline being the Watchtower of the Golden Key. Honestly there are probably dozens of ways you could interpret this image in either Chronicles of Darkness or World of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T20:31:57-08:00","id":1055065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1055050-so-can-mages-go-to-different-dimensions-and-such?p=1055054#post1055054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is the nWoD/CofD forum, where mages explore the inner expressions of the Astral Realms and the totemic reflections of the Shadow Realm. oWoD/cWoD/just plain WoD Mage is the one where mages travel through the Near Umbra and reach further into the Horizon.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure either game can find a good place for your inspirational artwork (whether or not it's one of the game's otherworlds). It's just a question of what is evoking it.</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you mean evoking?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-26T09:35:59-08:00","id":1055283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magicballz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1055050-so-can-mages-go-to-different-dimensions-and-such?p=1055065#post1055065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What do you mean evoking?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>What the artwork evokes, what the artist is trying to depict, what his symbology means.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Memb